    "__typename": "Event",
    "id": "312850971",
    "token": "312850971",
    "title": "PSYCHEDELIC YOGA In-Person Workshop!",
    "description": "**January 4, 4:00-6:00pm at Daya Yoga, Brooklyn**\n*Only $20 for a unique, two-hour workshop!*\n\nREGISTER HERE: [https://dayayoga.studiogrowth.com/class/385605](https://dayayoga.studiogrowth.com/class/385605)\n\nThis workshop introduces **[Psychedelic Yoga](https://dayayoga.studiogrowth.com/class/385605)**, a collection of practices to cultivate non-ordinary states of consciousness to support **healing, spiritual exploration, and creative flow**. Each practice in Psychedelic Yoga can be applied to everyday life.\n\nWe'll journey through **gentle postures** that open energetic pathways, **breathwork** that can shift consciousness as powerfully as any substance, and **sound healing with live didgeridoo** vibrations that create resonance in the body's energy centers.\n\nDrawing from **Tibetan Dream Yoga**, we'll practice meditations that reveal the dream-like nature of all experience. We'll explore our senses mindfully\u2014savoring **grapes** as a gateway to presence, and for the adventuresome, experiencing **nail boards** as a practice in working skillfully with intense feelings.\n\n**Optional high-quality cannabis edibles will be offered for FREE.**\n\nEveryone is welcome, from beginners wanting a unique and deeply relaxing experience to yoga teachers, therapists, and psychedelic journeyers seeking new methods. The practices are designed to calm the mind and reduce suffering, bringing us closer to our natural state of awareness and joy.\n\n*[Come learn and practice Psychedelic Yoga with us!](https://dayayoga.studiogrowth.com/class/385605)*",
    "aeoDescription": "In-person Psychedelic Yoga workshop for beginners and practitioners; learn gentle postures, breathwork, and sound healing to calm the mind and reduce suffering.",
