    "speakerDetails": {
      "__typename": "SpeakerDetails",
      "name": "Henry Kandel",
      "description": "**Henry Kandel** designs events that combine many different forms of yoga, intentional psychedelic use, healing and creative flow. \u00a0They've taught asana, pranayama, and meditation for psychedelic experience, and have run dozens of workshops integrating cannabis. \u00a0They pioneered Ketamine-State Yoga, and have taught it to therapists, yogis, and hundreds of folks online.\n\nThey have taught math and science at Saint Ann\u2019s School for 30 years.\u00a0 They designed and taught original courses in Physics, Astronomy and Game Theory, as well as electives such as \u201cThe Sci of Sci-Fi,\u201d \u201cScience of Music,\u201d and, \u201cDream, Sleep, and Consciousness.\u201d\n\nThey've practiced many forms of yoga over the same time period, focusing on pranayama and Tibetan Dream Yoga.\u00a0 Psychedelics, combined with yogic practice, have brought them vast spiritual and mental-health benefits.",
